  "details": "It would be useful for performance to have a SetProgramVariable/GetProgramVariable variant to Udon that takes an address rather than a name of a symbol.\nThis would allow programs to avoid the overhead of looking up the address from the symbol name at runtime if they have a compiler that can link the addresses of variables at compile time.\n\nThis is similar to https://vrchat.canny.io/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-feedback/p/expose-udonbehaviour-runprogram but for variables instead of methods",
